#. 遅いよ、２人ともッ！！
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You guys are too slow!"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんが…速すぎるんだよ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I think you're just...too fast..."
msgstr ""

#. それで…どう大変なんだ？
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So? What's this emergency?"
msgstr ""

#. 女子更衣室の一件の後、
#. 腐川ちゃんを部屋で休ませてたんだけど…
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Well, after what happened in the girls locker room, we\n"
"left Toko in her room so she could lay down."
msgstr ""

#. しばらくしてから、様子見ようと声かけたんだ。
#. けど、そうしたら…
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"After a while, we came back to check on her. Ya know,\n"
"see how she was doing. But when we did..."
msgstr ""

#. なんか様子がおかしくって…
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...it was weird."
msgstr ""

#. 中から絶対に出て来ようとしないし、
#. なんか<CLT 3>変な事<CLT>ばっか言ってるし…
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"She refused to come out, and she kept saying all this\n"
"<CLT 3>weird stuff<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …変な事？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Weird stuff...?"
msgstr ""

#. 直接、声を掛けてみるか…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "We should try talking to her ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…そうだね…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, good idea."
msgstr ""

#. とりあえず…
#. 腐川ちゃんに声かけてみてよ。
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Let's try talking to Toko again..."
msgstr ""

#. それにしても心配だな…腐川ちゃん。
msgctxt "0012 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm just really worried about her."
msgstr ""

#. 誰か…<CLT 3>彼女を説得出来そうな人<CLT>は
#. いないのかなぁ…
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Isn't there anyone who <CLT 3>might be able to persuade\n"
"her<CLT>...?"
msgstr ""

#. …話す相手を間違えているぞ、クズが。
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You're talking to the wrong person, you waste of\n"
"space."
msgstr ""

#. …さっさとしろ。
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hurry up and do it."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、十神クンから腐川さんに
#. お願い出来ないかな？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Byakuya...you think you could ask her?"
msgstr ""

#. 部屋から出て来るようにってさ…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "To come out of her room, I mean."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. まぁ、いいだろう…
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Sure, whatever."
msgstr ""

#. …へ？　十神が説得してくれんの？
#. 意外、優しいトコもあんじゃん！
msgctxt "0020 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Huh? You're gonna talk to her, Byakuya? Wow, I guess\n"
"you can be nice when you want to!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>十神クンは無言のままドアの前に立つと、
#. その指をインターホンに重ねた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya stood in front of her door, not making a\n"
"sound, and pressed the doorbell.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ピンポーン…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しばらくすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After a few moments...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 放っておいて！　しつここここ…
msgctxt "0025 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Leave me alone! You're all s-s-s-so annoying..."
msgstr ""

#. こがみ君ッ！！
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Ah—! Backula!"
msgstr ""

#. 十神だ…
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It's Byakuya..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ご、ごめんなさい…
#. <CLT 3>約束<CLT>…守れなかった……
msgctxt "0029 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I-I'm sorry. I couldn't k-keep our <CLT 3>promise<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…安心して…
#. これ以上は…もう……
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "But don't w-worry. Never again..."
msgstr ""

#. あたしがッ…！
#. ジェノサイダー翔の好きにはさせないからッ！！
msgctxt "0031 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I...! I won't let Genocide Jack have control ever\n"
"again!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして…再びドアは閉じた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And with that, the door slammed shut.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 十神でも…駄目だったかぁ…
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Even Byakuya couldn't pull it off..."
msgstr ""

#. 仕方あるまい。では捜査に戻るとしよう。
msgctxt "0034 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There's nothing else we can do. Let's get back to the\n"
"investigation."
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと待って！
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hold on!"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、十神クン…
#. 今の腐川さんの言葉ってどういう意味？
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Byakuya. What was Toko talking about just now?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>約束<CLT>が…どうとか…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Something about a <CLT 3>promise<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. …約束？　知らんな。
#. また妄想癖が出てきただけじゃないのか？
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hm? Oh, I have no idea. Another one of her delusions,\n"
"I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-But..."
msgstr ""

#. 知らんと言ったら知らん。
#. 腐川の事は、朝日奈に任せておけばいい…
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If I say I don't know, that means I don't know. Just\n"
"let Hina take care of her."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…わかったよ…
#. じゃあ、私はここで見張ってるね。
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"O-Oh...yeah, okay. I'll stay here and keep an eye on\n"
"her."
msgstr ""

#. では、行くぞ。
msgctxt "0042 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well then, let's go."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンはボクの返事も待たず、
#. さっさと歩き出してしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without waiting for a reply, Byakuya sped away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. と、十神クン…ッ！
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-Byakuya!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、慌ててその後を追った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And I hurried to catch up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>道すがら、何度も十神クンに声をかけたものの…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tried to talk to him several times as we walked...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>返事はおろか、
#. 彼は振り返る事さえしなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...but he didn't even look back, let alone say\n"
"anything.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただ、目的地へと向かって、
#. 歩を進めるだけだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He just kept on walking toward his destination.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな彼の足は…
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“ある部屋”<CLT><CLT 4>の前でようやく止まった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Finally, his feet brought him to a stop in front of <CLT><CLT 3>a\n"
"certain room<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はそれどころじゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's not the time for this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はそれどころじゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's not the time for this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はそれどころじゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's not the time for this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はそれどころじゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's not the time for this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はそれどころじゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's not the time for this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はそれどころじゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's not the time for this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは女子トイレだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the girls bathroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もちろん、入る訳にはいかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Obviously I can't go in...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はそれどころじゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's not the time for this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このタイミングで部屋に帰っても仕方がない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Going back to my room right now wouldn't help\n"
"anything.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はそれどころじゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's not the time for this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さん…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Sayaka...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…でも、今は、
#. 感傷に浸ってる場合じゃないんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...No, now's no time to get lost in sentimentality.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここに…腐川さんが？
#. それにしても、緊急事態って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is Toko...inside? Some kind of emergency...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>インターホンを鳴らしてみるか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I may as well give it a shot...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ピンポーン…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すると、ドアは音もなく、
#. ゆっくりと開き…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door swung open, slowly and silently.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0067 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>こ、これは…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>H-Holy crap...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>開かれたドアの隙間から流れ出してくる負のオーラに、
#. ボクは思わず息をのんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>An aura of negativity flowed out from behind the door,\n"
"forcing a gasp out of me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ……何？
msgctxt "0070 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…朝日奈さんが心配してて…
#. 腐川さんが閉じこもってるって…
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Oh, um...nothing. It's just that...Hina was really\n"
"worried about you, holing yourself up in your room..."
msgstr ""

#. 放っておいて……
msgctxt "0072 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Leave me a-alone..."
msgstr ""

#. えーっとさ…
#. とりあえず、１度ドアを開けてくれない？
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Um, yeah, sure thing. But...could you open up, just\n"
"for a second...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0074 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. す…きに…させない……
msgctxt "0075 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Won't a-allow it..."
msgstr ""

#. えっ…？
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. ジェノサイダー翔なんかの…
#. す、好きにはさせない…ッ！！
msgctxt "0077 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I w-won't let Genocide Jack have control!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ドアは勢いよく閉じた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And just like that, she slammed the door in my face.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. え…？　え、え…？
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What was that...?"
msgstr ""

#. ずっと…あんな調子なの。
#. さっき、私がインターホンを押した時なんてね…
msgctxt "0080 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"She's been acting like that the whole time. When I\n"
"rang a little while ago..."
msgstr ""

#. ひ、人殺しの…さ、殺人鬼なんて…
#. 追い出してやるッ！！
msgctxt "0081 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'll d-drive out...the killer... D-Drive out the\n"
"murderous fiend..."
msgstr ""

#. …意味わかんなくない？
msgctxt "0082 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It doesn't make any sense, right?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、放っておくのも心配だから、
#. 無理矢理ドアをこじ開けようとしたんだけど…
msgctxt "0083 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"I was afraid to leave her in there alone, so I tried\n"
"to bust down her door..."
msgstr ""

#. なんか、内側からドアを固定してるみたいで、
#. あれ以上は開かないんだよね…
msgctxt "0084 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...but it felt like something was holding it shut on\n"
"the other side. I couldn't even budge it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ドアまで固定して…
#. 腐川さんがそこまで怯えるなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Toko was scared enough to even bar her door...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女も…十神クンと同じ考えなのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does she think the same thing as Byakuya?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんを殺したのは、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>連続殺人鬼ジェノサイダー翔<CLT><CLT 4>だと思ってる？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does she think the <CLT><CLT 3>serial killer Genocide Jack<CLT><CLT 4>\n"
"really murdered Chihiro?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから、腐川さんは…
#. こんなにジェノサイダー翔に怯えている？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that why Toko's so scared...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても心配だな…腐川ちゃん。
msgctxt "0089 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Whatever it is, I'm really worried about her..."
msgstr ""

#. 誰か…<CLT 3>彼女を説得出来そうな人<CLT>は、
#. いないのかなぁ…
msgctxt "0090 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Isn't there anyone who <CLT 3>might be able to persuade\n"
"her<CLT>...?"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても心配だな…腐川ちゃん。
msgctxt "0091 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Whatever it is, I'm really worried about her..."
msgstr ""

#. 誰か…<CLT 3>彼女を説得出来そうな人<CLT>は
#. いないのかなぁ…
msgctxt "0092 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Isn't there anyone who <CLT 3>might be able to persuade\n"
"her<CLT>...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今はそれどころじゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now's not the time for this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

